\item{\code{lm}}{Multiple regression, marked when p < \code{alpha}.}
\item{\code{step}}{Stepwise regression in both directions using BIC.}
\item{\code{alasso}}{Adaptive lasso; see \code{\link[=alasso]{alasso()}}.}
\item{\code{subsets}}{Exhaustive best subsets, model chosen by lowest BIC. With
\code{subsets_boot = TRUE}, a second row marks predictors selected in at
least \code{boot_cutoff} of bootstrap resamples.}
\item{\code{rf}}{VSURF, which returns an interpretation set (all variables
related to the outcome) and a smaller prediction set. With
\code{rf_lm = TRUE}, each set is refitted with \code{lm()} and marked when
